SUMMARY:🎶 Fri Spirit Express: Amy Steinberg & Jesse Powers — Live in 
 Concert 🎶
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🎶 Fri Spirit Expre
 ss: Amy Steinberg & Jesse Powers — Live in Concert 🎶\n\n**Friday\, Se
 ptember 18th @ 7:00 PM**\n✨ **Two powerhouse voices. One unforgettable e
 vening.** ✨\n\nJoin us for a soulful\, joyful night with **Amy Steinberg
  & Jesse Powers**\, two dynamic performers and songwriters coming together
  for a special evening of **original music\, storytelling\, laughter\, and
  connection.**\n\nTheir music moves effortlessly from the deeply heartfelt
  to the downright celebratory. With distinctive voices\, powerful songwrit
 ing\, and plenty of spontaneity\, Amy and Jesse create the kind of concert
  experience that invites you to be fully present—and fully alive.\n\n
 💫 **What to expect:**\n\n* 🎤 Powerful live vocals and original music
 \n* 🎶 Songs that touch the heart and lift the spirit\n* 📖 Storytelli
 ng and moments of connection\n* 😂 Plenty of laughter and joy\n* 💃 A 
 little spontaneity and celebration\n* ❤️ An evening filled with heart\
 , soul\, and community\n\nCome ready to **laugh\, feel\, sing\, and celebr
 ate**—and leave a little more alive than you came in!\n\n💰 **Suggeste
 d Love Offering: $20–$30**\nYour generous contribution helps support liv
 e music and community programming at **Center for Spiritual Living Ashevil
 le**.\n\n📅 **Friday\, September 18th**\n⏰ **7:00 PM**\n📍 **Communi
 ty Commons at Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**\n\n*Bring a friend\,
  open your heart\, and come experience the magic of two extraordinary voic
 es sharing one stage. ✨*\n\n#FriSpiritExpress #AmySteinberg #JessePowers
  #LiveMusic #LiveInConcert #OriginalMusic #SoulfulMusic #MusicAndConnectio
 n #CommunityCommonsAsheville #cslasheville #spiritualcommunity #InspiredLi
 ving
